			"color":"#262",
			"widgets_values":[
				"A 13-second cinematic product video of a striped knit T-shirt hanging on a wooden branch in a sunlit forest. Pure still life, no models, mannequins, or hands. Shot on 35mm with shallow depth of field and a heavily blurred green background. \n\nFeatures a sequence of fast, elegant cuts:\n- Shot 1: Medium shot of the full T-shirt swaying gently in the breeze.\n- Shot 2: Angled close-up of the chest area.\n- Shot 3: Extreme close-up of the 'Be Playful' embroidery and patches.\n- Shot 4: Close-up of the ribbed collar and brand label.\n- Shot 5: Detailed shot of the folded sleeve drape.\n- Shot 6: Close-up of the stitched bottom hem.\n- Shot 7: Macro texture of the soft cotton fabric weave.\n- Shot 8: Low-angle hero shot looking up at the shirt.\n- Shot 9: Backlit shot with warm sun flare shining through the trees.\n\nRealistic fabric weight, moving dappled sunlight, no jitter, no warping, no studio backgrounds."
			],
